      "targetHash": "e47e160e4e1e08cb0b649ac4c5fdccc83489d2eee2cc27fce2068420ac73f6c3",
      "machineHash": "e47e160e4e1e08cb0b649ac4c5fdccc83489d2eee2cc27fce2068420ac73f6c3",
      "machineText": "`CmdOrCtrl` ditetapkan menjadi Command di macOS serta Control di Windows dan Linux, sehingga praktis digunakan untuk pintasan lintas platform.",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "`CmdOrCtrl` resolves to Command on macOS and Control on Windows and Linux, which makes it convenient…",
      "provider": "codex",
